ts should end a party when it is finished.</p></section><section><h2 class="text-lg font-black text-cyan-300">6. Service availability</h2><p class="mt-2">KC Jukebox depends on third-party services. Features may be unavailable if those services experience an outage, change their APIs or restrict access.</p></section><section><h2 class="text-lg font-black text-cyan-300">7. General information only</h2><p class="mt-2">Information about private use or music licensing is general information only. If unsure whether an event requires licensing, obtain appropriate professional or licensing advice.</p></section></div><div class="mt-9 rounded-2xl border border-fuchsia-500/20 bg-fuchsia-500/5 p-5 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-300"><strong class="text-fuchsia-300">In short:</strong> use KC Jukebox for private parties with your own Spotify account. Do not use it as a commercial or public-venue jukebox.</div><div class="mt-8 flex gap-3"><NuxtLink to="/" class="neon-btn-cyan">Back Home</NuxtLink><NuxtLink to="/host/signup" class="neon-btn">Create Host Account</NuxtLink></div></section></div></main></template>